        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do ONE+ HP tools work with old Ryobi batteries?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Ryobi states that any 18V ONE+ battery works with any 18V ONE+ product, so older packs fit the HP brushless tools. They will not deliver the tool's best performance on high-draw jobs, though. Ryobi says HP tools are built to get the most from its high-performance packs, so pair saws and impact wrenches with a larger pack."
