          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Not all Ryobi tools are brushless. In the 18V ONE+ range, the brushless tools are the ONE+ HP models, and Ryobi names them as brushless; the basic ONE+ tools without the HP badge use brushed motors. Every ONE+ battery fits every ONE+ tool either way, while the 40V outdoor line is a separate system.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Buy the HP brushless version of the tools that work hard, starting with the drill and impact driver, and save money with brushed tools for light, occasional jobs. Check the name and model number on ryobitools.com before you pay HP prices, and pair high-draw tools with a larger battery.
